These are primary sources the csoh.org kill chain cites. Every fact about the incident in this deck comes from that page, which draws on these.

The FBI and CISA joint advisory is AA23-320A. Mandiant's three posts are listed on the page as UNC3944 SaaS targeting, hardening guidance, and SMS phishing and SIM swapping. MITRE ATT&CK's page for the group is G1015. The page also links GuidePoint's GRIT analysis, CrowdStrike's Not a SIMulation, and Morphisec's analysis of the MGM attack.

The page cites further sources not listed here: FS-ISAC mitigation guidance, Panther's analysis of the attack and Okta, and MITRE ATT&CK technique pages.

The background slides name their own sources, from the csoh.org glossary, Microsoft Learn and MITRE ATT&CK.

